? on the map opens the help sheet with Navigate, Edit and Naming a node on the left and Canvas, Find & views, File and App on the right, showing the unified keymap chords.
note: Trip.md
events: key:m+cmd@0.3 key:?@0.8
expect: text:help-Navigate: "NAVIGATE Left h Right l Select left / right Up k Down j Select up / down Home g g Root Space f Fold or unfold Shift+Space F Fold or unfold the branch ] [ Unfold everything / fold to a level Ctrl+Enter Follow the node's link"
expect: text:help-Canvas: 'CANVAS 0 1 Shift+1 Fit the map L Choose the layout + = Ctrl+= Ctrl++ - Ctrl+- Zoom in / out Ctrl+0 Zoom 100% c Centre the node'
expect: text:help-Edit: 'EDIT F2 e E Edit the node / its branch Shift+F10 or right-click Node menu Tab Enter Shift+Enter Add a child / sibling / sibling before Delete Backspace Delete the branch x Tick the task Alt+Up Alt+Down Alt+Left Alt+Right Move the node Shift+Tab Outdent Ctrl+Alt+1 – Ctrl+Alt+6 Heading 1 to 6 Ctrl+Z Ctrl+Shift+Z Ctrl+Y Undo / redo Ctrl+X Ctrl+C Ctrl+Shift+C Cut / copy node / branch Ctrl+Shift+A Copy the whole note Ctrl+V Paste as child / sibling'
expect: text:help-Find & views: 'FIND & VIEWS Ctrl+F / Find n F3 Ctrl+G N Shift+F3 Ctrl+Shift+G Next / previous match Esc Close find or cancel drag b B Ctrl+B Sidebar o O Ctrl+O Outline Ctrl+E p Ctrl+P m Ctrl+M Ctrl+Shift+K Source / preview / map / board z . , i Zen / settings / image ? Ctrl+/ F1 This sheet'
